Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： HSQ-Rip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕時間軸由kewenyu調整以適應當前作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Cosmic Era 72
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:10.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球·Plant之間歷時一年半的戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:15.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於在雅金·多維宇域的戰鬥中迎來了終結
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:18.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,經過雙方同意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:22.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在過去的悲劇發生地猶尼奧斯七號上締結的條約
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.99,0:00:26.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,成為雙方今後相互理解努力追求和平的誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:30.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界再次開始走向安定...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:36.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今為什麼還需要那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.09,0:00:40.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們發過誓 不再重複悲劇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.89,0:00:43.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽手共同前進
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.51,0:00:46.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說漂亮話不愧是阿斯哈的看家本領
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.57,0:00:47.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.41,0:00:54.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,BogeyOne 捕捉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.71,0:00:56.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Orange55 Mark90 Alpha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:59.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裏直接做個了斷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.39,0:01:00.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員戰鬥配置
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:02.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,機師到待機室
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:18.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,BogeyOne嗎 那艘船真正的名稱到底叫什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.39,0:01:22.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gunner Zaku Warrior 連接彈射器
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪利亞·霍克 Zaku出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:32.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個 Impulse 請
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.70,0:01:37.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真·飛鳥 核心戰機出發
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:03.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,名稱是其存在的表現
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:08.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果那是假的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:13.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其存在本身也是虛假
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:15.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:18.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿雷克斯 不
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.51,0:02:20.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭·薩拉君
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:56.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,碎石戰的成績不太好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:04:00.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對方應該也已經捕捉到我們了 別大意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:05.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白 別學雷的口氣 聽著不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.92,0:04:11.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵艦有什麼動向
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.42,0:04:13.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有 航線速度保持不變
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:16.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 一號六號發射管
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.91,0:04:19.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一號到四號裝填Parsifal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.35,0:04:20.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,CIWS Tristan 啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:22.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次看准了打
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:24.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長 那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:04:58.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心 阿斯哈首相
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:02.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒打算為難他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:05.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我全都知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:10.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,包括卡納巴前議長對他們採取的措施
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:12.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過既然要談
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:18.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想和你真正的身份談 阿斯蘭君
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:20.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:30.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 為什麼沒任何反應
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:32.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse距離BogeyOne1400
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:37.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到現在都不改變航向嗎 怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:38.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道有什麼戰術
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:39.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:41.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是誘餌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:47.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:48.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.19,0:05:58.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夏爾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:03.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,散開 各自迎戰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:08.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 被伏擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:11.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,BogeyOne
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.94,0:06:13.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,BogeyOne丟失
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:14.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.05,0:06:18.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夏爾機信號消失
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:21.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Yellow60 Delta 熱紋3
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.85,0:06:24.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是 Chaos Gaia Abyss
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:28.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快索敵 找到BogeyOne
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.17,0:06:32.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Dagger隊出擊 引擎啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.82,0:06:35.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導彈發射管五號到八號發射
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:37.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主炮瞄準敵艦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:49.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Blue18 Mark9 Charley 熱紋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:52.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是BogeyOne 距離500
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.87,0:06:55.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有MS2
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:56.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,後面？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:58.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發現索敵鐳射照射
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:06.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反光線爆雷發射 右舵30 Tristan瞄準
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.61,0:07:09.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 Orange22 Delta有MS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:14.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎最大 以右舷小行星為盾進行迂回
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.85,0:07:30.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,美玲 招回真他們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的機體也準備出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.13,0:07:33.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:36.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,摩力珂 利用小行星表面的隆起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.01,0:07:38.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回避直擊彈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:38.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:40.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,亞瑟 迎擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:44.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,五號十號發射管 Parsifal發射
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:53.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:07:59.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,笛路
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.93,0:08:05.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼快損失了兩台
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.52,0:08:12.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦 我們中陷阱了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:14.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.09,0:08:17.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這樣下去即使回去...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:24.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Neidhart 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:31.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被抓住尾巴什麼都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:32.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法逼到前方嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:35.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太勉強 只回避就顧不過來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:36.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,放出雷的Zaku
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:38.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣出擊路線都保障不了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:01.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:05.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這些小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:08.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擊落
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:17.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迂回 奧盧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:19.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次要拿下見面禮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.95,0:09:21.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我並不太需要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:26.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣位置...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:27.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.58,0:09:38.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼又是你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:48.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣我方的一半火力都發揮不了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.47,0:09:51.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,浮動的岩石礙事 我們的炮火夠不到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:54.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很難纏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:57.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但艦船停止運動的話就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:10:01.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向他們緊貼著的小行星發射導彈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:05.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓他們好好淋個碎石浴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:07.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,直到埋住艦體
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.61,0:10:08.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:11.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我出去收尾 後面的拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.93,0:10:12.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:15.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導彈接近 數量6
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:16.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迎擊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:18.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:20.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是直擊彈道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.41,0:10:26.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 讓艦船離開小行星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:37.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 右舷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:40.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤離 上舵15
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:44.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第二波接近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.81,0:10:46.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,減速20
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:11:01.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,入水儀式還未舉行 真夠可憐的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.99,0:11:05.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我來收拾你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:11.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,四號六號加速器破損
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.14,0:11:14.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 這樣行動不了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:18.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,航線被阻塞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:21.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有MA MS接近
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.87,0:11:27.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艾布斯 讓雷出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:30.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但 但彈射器...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:33.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,走也得走出去 快
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:34.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真他們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:38.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse Zaku依然在和Chaos Gaia Abyss交戰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:41.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這艘船上已經沒有MS了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:43.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:49.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 用Tannhauser把前方的岩體...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.46,0:11:51.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算能轟開 也會騎上岩面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.93,0:11:54.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,相同量的岩塊飛散過來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:11.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉魯在密涅瓦裏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.23,0:12:13.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不能讓它被擊沉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:19.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 密涅瓦...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:21.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不回去的話會被擊沉的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:22.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:33.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:38.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舷的加速器還有幾個能用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:43.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,六個
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.81,0:12:45.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但就算用那個慢吞吞移出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:47.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只會成為好靶子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:52.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舷的炮同時一齊發射 向小行星
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:58.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓爆炸把艦體一口氣推出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:13:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連同周圍的岩石一起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.75,0:13:05.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別胡說 那樣的話密涅瓦的船體也會...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在擺脫現狀優先
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:11.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裏待下去也只是給人當靶子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:16.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,塔里婭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.19,0:13:19.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:21.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:23.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:25.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這事稍後再議 亞瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:29.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舷一側的火炮全部準備發射
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:32.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舷加速器 全開同時齊射
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:33.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,時機要抓准
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:36.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舷一側火炮 齊射準備
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:39.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發出信號同時 右舷加速器全開
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:48.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:49.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,白色小子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.49,0:13:55.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,礙事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:01.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,退下 米勒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:02.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙難對付
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.28,0:14:04.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你去對付母艦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:05.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:09.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別想得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:10.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.89,0:14:56.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙...那傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:03.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.57,0:15:05.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼那傢伙打不下來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:06.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣又會...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.49,0:15:08.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 最後一擊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:12.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被岩體阻擋 無法直接命中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.17,0:15:15.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓它無法追擊就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.90,0:15:17.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大佐可能會有想法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:22.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我們的MS能量也快吃緊了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.91,0:15:25.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,BogeyOne 距離150
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:27.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員 準備接受衝擊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:28.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.15,0:15:33.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舷加速器全開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.49,0:15:38.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舷全炮塔 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:15:59.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,密涅瓦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:03.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回轉30 攻擊BogeyOne
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.97,0:16:06.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tannhauser 瞄準 BogeyOne
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:13.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回避 左滿舵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:14.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:34.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種情況下竟還能起死回生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:49.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向奧格雷他們發返航信號
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.45,0:16:51.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤離此宇域
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:57.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,期待後會有期
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:16:59.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,白色小子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:01.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及紮夫特的諸位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:18.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣結束了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.35,0:17:19.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:21.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉 尼奧在叫我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:22.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我們回去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.96,0:17:35.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,BogeyOne 撤離
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:38.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse Zaku露娜瑪利亞機
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:39.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能量進入危險區域
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:41.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長由於剛才的爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:44.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第二引擎與左舷熱感測器也...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:45.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,庫拉緹絲艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:50.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就夠了 之後再另覓良策吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:56.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不能再連累阿斯哈首相了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.19,0:17:59.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.12,0:18:15.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的非常抱歉 阿斯哈首相
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.21,0:18:17.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請不用顧慮我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:20.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 對於出現這樣的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.23,0:18:22.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也感到十分遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,衷心希望能得到早日解決
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.51,0:18:27.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.37,0:18:34.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 姐姐 雷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:37.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了 還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:41.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,另外終於和本國取得聯絡了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:46.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭·薩拉 是那傢伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:52.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經派出救援和調查隊前往ArmonyOne
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.83,0:18:57.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並要求調來其中一艘迎接各位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:18:58.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:03.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 剛才多虧了他才得救呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.13,0:19:04.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:06.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.47,0:19:14.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,名不虛傳啊 身經百戰的實力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:15.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:19.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多有冒犯之處 非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:24.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的判斷是正確的 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:28.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼告辭了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.25,0:19:35.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這艦上已經沒有MS了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:38.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.58,0:19:40.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夏爾機也失去信號
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:20:00.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那是假的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.21,0:20:05.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其存在本身也是虛假
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:07.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.46,0:20:15.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 非得改名換姓不可嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:17.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他以前是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.77,0:20:21.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼呢 就算以前...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:31.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正在討論你的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.61,0:20:32.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭·薩拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:37.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,該說沒想到 還是果然
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:40.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然能在這裏見到傳說中的王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.63,0:20:41.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,甚感榮幸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.87,0:20:44.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你弄錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:46.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫阿雷克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:50.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以已經不再駕駛MS了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:53.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算了露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.63,0:20:56.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,留在奧布的傢伙什麼也不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:00.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,失陪了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:05.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 聽說你幫助艦船脫險
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.47,0:21:07.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感激不盡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.57,0:21:11.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:19.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.15,0:21:22.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 確認過好幾次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.46,0:21:24.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請看 這是兩小時前的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:26.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在雖然也只是緩緩地
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:27.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但毫無疑問在移動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:29.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:32.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,猶尼奧斯7應該是在安定軌道上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.78,0:22:10.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 我是瑪尤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.65,0:22:14.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 現在瑪尤不能接電話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.64,0:22:18.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一會兒再聯絡 請在信號音後留名...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:25.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始移動的墓碑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.76,0:23:30.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,冰封的是逝者的記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.84,0:23:33.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是生者的淚水
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.34,0:23:39.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲慟的哭號 如今仍刺痛著阿斯蘭的心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:43.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士 GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.29,0:23:45.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不癒的傷痕
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.80,0:23:49.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拋出痛苦的回憶吧 GINN
